  - m_Id: 15499611127808
    m_Localized: It looks like an evil eagle has kidnapped a birdy, you need to save
      it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63141875597312
    m_Localized: Well, the time has come. You've completed all the levels and now
      you have one final push to save the bird! Mark the correct answers to the questions
      to damage the boss, but be careful, the questions will vary, and if you don't
      answer within 15 seconds, the boss will attack you. Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
